  "id": "the-naked-director-s01e07-scene-12",
  "pair": "ja-en",
  "title": "ご納得いただけましたか？  (Have We Convinced You?)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "kawada": "川田",
    "keieisha": "経営者",
    "kuroki": "黒木"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Kawada brings Kuroki in person to screen her debut tape for the video chain Proprietor, whose astonishment at the articulate university student wins their studio a nationwide exclusive launch. Listen for \"megami\", goddess.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "keieisha",
      "t": "これがデビュー作？あんた本当にシロウトさんか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "ええ、教育学部美術学科の三年生です。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "keieisha",
      "t": "とんでもねえのがいたな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "ええ、村西監督に開花していただきました。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "この撮影で私は自由を手にしたんです。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "keieisha",
      "t": "おい、何だこのお姉さん。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "女神ですよ、我々の。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "でもポセイドンには逆らえないんでしたっけ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "ほら貝です。ご納得いただけましたか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "keieisha",
      "t": "十分だ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "各店舗、二百本ずつね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "よし、お願いします。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "keieisha",
      "t": "これがデビュー作？あんた本当にシロウトさんか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This is your debut work? Are you really an amateur?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "ええ、教育学部美術学科の三年生です。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yes, I am a third-year university student majoring in art education.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "keieisha",
      "t": "とんでもねえのがいたな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Someone truly extraordinary was hiding out there.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "ええ、村西監督に開花していただきました。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yes, Director Muranishi helped me blossom.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "この撮影で私は自由を手にしたんです。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Through this shoot, I took hold of my own freedom.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "keieisha",
      "t": "おい、何だこのお姉さん。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hey, who on earth is this young lady?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "女神ですよ、我々の。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'She is our goddess.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "でもポセイドンには逆らえないんでしたっけ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Oh, wait—weren't you unable to defy Poseidon?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "ほら貝です。ご納得いただけましたか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That sound is a conch shell. Have we convinced you?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "keieisha",
      "t": "十分だ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'More than enough.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "各店舗、二百本ずつね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Two hundred tapes for each branch store across the country.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "よし、お願いします。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'All right, let's make this happen.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
